    "body": "The current research result and next action were spread across stale “current” roadmap sections, while the proposed tooling/source audit had no native execution homes. This adopts the integrated workflow, adds a concise current map and reusable continuation prompt, and binds the missing interface, UOR, language/context, native artifact, lowering, coding, publication and source-mapping work to native issues.\n\nThe delivery includes the local read-only knowledge MCP, explicit provenance-preserving seed/live-sync commands, storage inventory, public source/research dossier and initial claim ledger. Private repositories/history stay outside the public records; sync rejects private GitHub repositories and escaping document symlinks. Historical measurements are retained. The next scientific experiment remains separately scoped in #1082; this PR does not change the model or run it.\n\nValidation: independent source review GO; JSON/local source links/public-source separation; real native-graph/plan sync (21 selected issues) and idempotent reimport; private-repository/symlink rejection; prior unchanged package/tool behavior receipts. Broad QA/model/teacher/BDD/WASM/fuzz suites NOT_RUN. Required acknowledgements are transport only.\n\nCloses #1081.\n",
